# Dredger's Insight: "leave YOUR graveyard". On turn 4 Bot2 bolts its own Llanowar Elves, and in Bot2's second main phase
# Bot1 casts Second Sunrise, which returns the Elves to the battlefield from Bot2's graveyard (Bot1 has no creature or
# artifact card that went to its graveyard from the battlefield). A creature card left a graveyard, but not Bot1's: Bot1
# gains no life. (The positive control, cards leaving Bot1's own graveyard, is the "two cards leaving together" scenario.)

